gomodel:6ab067da00005685
        a                      owl:Ontology ;
        rdfs:comment           "Curated with GO AI HUB. ATG2A transfers PE from the ER (supplied by the TMEM41B scramblase) to the phagophore, where ATG9A scrambles it; WDR45/WIPI4 positively regulates ATG2A, in autophagosome assembly." , "Curated with GO AI HUB. Added: the TOM70-TOM40 (TOM complex) recruits ATG2A to the MAM as a protein-membrane adaptor (PMID:31412244)." ;
